    "preamble": "Sunil Shankar Raut (Nominee) And Anr vs The State Of Maharashtra on 3 January, 2024 Author: Prakash D. Naik Bench: Prakash D. Naik 1 of 2 7.APL.1156.2016.doc In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Criminal Appellate Jurisdiction Criminal Application No.1156 Of 2016 Sunil Shankar Raut (Nominee) and another Applicants versus The State of Maharashtra Respondent Mr.Kirti Parekh, Advocate for Applicants. Mr.Y.Y.Dabake, App, for State. Coram : Prakash D. Naik, J. Date : 3rd January 2024 Pc : 1.",
